#: mvc/app/views/OPNsense/PolicyAnalyzer/index.volt:1216
msgid ""
"Install opens the quarantine setup: ledger, aliases pa_quarantine and "
"pa_never_block, the rule Max Cyber IA, scenarios, a cron job every 5 minutes "
"and the first run, one step at a time; every step is simulated first and can "
"be undone alone."
